# SpecExportCorrect (B) — PRIMARY RelNode interpreter source pins.
#
# Canonical cross-prover surface:
#   formalsql/logical/*  ↔  tests/verification/logical/dafny/*
#
# Updating a pin is an explicit TCB review. Do not bump casually.
# Presence/hash ≠ semantic equivalence (see GENERIC_INTERPRETER_TCB.md).
#
# Hashed by check_spec_export.sh (canonical RelNode section) — every Rocq
# source that defines canonical logical-language / interpreter semantics:
#   formalsql/logical/SqlTypes.v
#   formalsql/logical/Schema.v
#   formalsql/logical/Expr.v
#   formalsql/logical/Agg.v
#   formalsql/logical/RelNode.v
#   formalsql/logical/Typing.v
#   formalsql/logical/Eval.v
#   tests/verification/logical/dafny/LogicalSpec.dfy
#   tests/verification/logical/dafny/EvalLogicalSpec.dfy
#
# Not pinned here (not interpreter semantics authority):
#   LogicalSpecSerialize.v (DATA dump only), proof/Morphisms.v (lemmas)
#
# TCB note (list GroupStore): Dafny RelEvalLogicalSpec GroupStore is
# seq<GroupEntry> with unique-key StoreGet/StorePut semantics — dual of
# Rocq Eval.GroupStore (list (keys * Acc)). Physical maps remain for Twin/accel.
# Module renamed RelEvalLogicalSpec to avoid colliding with q1 flat EvalLogicalSpec.
#
# Flat migration pins: interpreter_source_migration_flat.pin

